usage: niagara_help slots [-h] [--type {properties,actions,topics}] [--by-type BY_TYPE] [--json]
                          [--inherited]
                          [query]

positional arguments:
  query                 Class name or slot name/pattern

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --type {properties,actions,topics}
  --by-type BY_TYPE     Search by property TYPE (e.g. BStatusNumeric)
  --json                Output as JSON
  --inherited           All slots of the class QUERY including those inherited from its parents
                        (replaces inherited-slots; no --type / --by-type)
